1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 31=

4
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,000
Yan Shang,

5
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:43,230
you made such bold promises,

6
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:46,640
yet failed to serve me
with all your loyalty and ability.

7
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:49,230
You've failed to live up
to my expectations.

8
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:51,230
I

9
00:01:51,790 --> 00:01:52,310
admit my guilt.

10
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:54,920
The corruption in Lingnan

11
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:57,510
was practically out in the open.

12
00:01:57,950 --> 00:01:59,510
Yet you claim you found nothing.

13
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:04,120
How do I know you haven't colluded
with those corrupt officials

14
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,640
and submitted a false report?

15
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,310
For such gross negligence,

16
00:02:08,150 --> 00:02:09,960
even stripping you of your post
and executing you

17
00:02:10,470 --> 00:02:11,400
wouldn't be too harsh.

18
00:02:12,030 --> 00:02:12,590
Father!

19
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,080
However,

20
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,400
I've decided to show you mercy.

21
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:27,840
I'll grant Wanyao's request

22
00:02:28,630 --> 00:02:29,870
and banish you from Sheng'an,

23
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,750
never to return.

24
00:02:32,590 --> 00:02:33,520
Go to Lanyang.

25
00:02:34,470 --> 00:02:35,430
Serve as county magistrate.

26
00:02:40,310 --> 00:02:40,800
Yan Shang,

27
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:42,520
thank His Majesty.

28
00:03:06,710 --> 00:03:07,310
(Today)

29
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,120
(may be our final farewell.)

30
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,750
(But as long as you choose life,
there's hope.)

31
00:03:13,430 --> 00:03:14,710
(Locked in this gilded cage,)

32
00:03:15,870 --> 00:03:17,360
(all by myself.)

33
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:18,960
(And that's enough.)

34
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,400
(Stay alive,)

35
00:03:25,470 --> 00:03:25,960
(Yan Shang.)

36
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:31,480
(Huaiji County Financial Ledger;
Households, Land, Taxes)

37
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,430
What's this?

38
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,150
Your Majesty,

39
00:03:39,310 --> 00:03:40,590
I've reconstructed from memory

40
00:03:41,470 --> 00:03:43,240
three years of financial records
from Lingnan Circuit.

41
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:50,870
Bring it here.

42
00:03:54,740 --> 00:03:55,980
(Huaiji County Financial Ledger;
Households, Land, Taxes)

43
00:04:10,740 --> 00:04:15,960
(Huaiji County Financial Ledger;
Households, Land, Taxes)

44
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,190
You wrote all this from memory?

45
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,430
I reconstructed this ledger

46
00:04:22,190 --> 00:04:23,870
from memory while in prison.

47
00:04:24,830 --> 00:04:26,120
Jiang Heng, Military Commander
of Lingnan,

48
00:04:26,750 --> 00:04:28,750
secretly conspired with the Crown Prince
and funneled him money.

49
00:04:29,310 --> 00:04:31,800
Under the guise of public works,
he enriched himself.

50
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:33,800
Across 93 counties,

51
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,390
fields lie barren
and granaries stand empty.

52
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:38,040
People sell their wives and children,
yet still can't pay their taxes.

53
00:04:38,870 --> 00:04:40,070
Bones lie scattered
across the countryside,

54
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:41,950
yet the authorities still demand
forced labor.

55
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:48,480
I humbly beg Your Majesty

56
00:04:48,950 --> 00:04:50,160
to execute these corrupt officials

57
00:04:50,750 --> 00:04:53,240
and bring peace to Lingnan's
countless innocent souls!

58
00:04:59,580 --> 00:05:01,820
(Previous Grain Balance: 4,200 shi;
New Receipts: 2,800 shi)

59
00:05:07,510 --> 00:05:10,000
With nothing but your eyes and memory,

60
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,070
you remembered all of this?

61
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:13,480
Father!

62
00:05:14,750 --> 00:05:15,390
He's lost his mind!

63
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:17,510
He's scribbled all this
without a shred of evidence.

64
00:05:18,190 --> 00:05:19,070
How can you believe him?

65
00:05:19,270 --> 00:05:21,950
I ask Your Majesty to choose any year,
prefecture, or county

66
00:05:22,870 --> 00:05:24,240
and investigate whatever you wish.

67
00:05:25,070 --> 00:05:25,870
Whether I've fabricated anything

68
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,480
will be clear once the records
are compared.

69
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:28,750
Very well.

70
00:05:30,190 --> 00:05:33,000
I'll summon those involved
for questioning

71
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,310
and verify

72
00:05:35,270 --> 00:05:36,390
every page of these records.

73
00:05:38,070 --> 00:05:39,510
Then when you said

74
00:05:40,390 --> 00:05:41,240
disaster relief had been ineffective

75
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,510
and your inspection
had uncovered nothing,

76
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,830
you were lying to me?

77
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,480
Take Yan Shang

78
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,240
back to the Imperial Prison.

79
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,070
- Yes, Your Majesty!
- Yes, Your Majesty!

80
00:06:19,830 --> 00:06:20,480
Wanyao,

81
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:23,950
it seems he really
doesn't want to go to Lanyang.

82
00:06:33,630 --> 00:06:34,070
Stop!

83
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:36,630
Move!

84
00:06:44,270 --> 00:06:44,800
Yan Shang,

85
00:06:45,870 --> 00:06:47,310
do you think you're some kind of hero?

86
00:06:49,390 --> 00:06:50,270
Let me tell you something.

87
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:53,390
You're

88
00:06:54,830 --> 00:06:55,750
the stupidest,

89
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:57,360
cruelest,

90
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:59,430
most self-righteous man in the world!

91
00:07:03,070 --> 00:07:03,600
I'm sorry.

92
00:07:04,430 --> 00:07:05,560
What did I tell you?

93
00:07:08,310 --> 00:07:09,510
What did you promise me?

94
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:12,720
Why did you lie to me?

95
00:07:14,870 --> 00:07:15,390
Yan Shang,

96
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,270
I've always despised

97
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,680
betrayal above all else.

98
00:07:20,460 --> 00:07:24,300
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

99
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:32,430
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- Let grief drown in your eyes♪

100
00:07:33,980 --> 00:07:36,951
♪- Soar with the wind;
- Plunge into hellfire as one♪

101
00:07:36,951 --> 00:07:38,809
♪Burning bright as a song♪

102
00:07:38,851 --> 00:07:42,241
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

103
00:07:42,860 --> 00:07:46,120
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

104
00:07:48,150 --> 00:07:51,520
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

105
00:07:52,780 --> 00:07:54,979
♪Not a single hour less♪

106
00:07:55,021 --> 00:08:01,731
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

107
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:05,900
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

108
00:08:06,100 --> 00:08:09,569
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

109
00:08:09,611 --> 00:08:16,211
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

110
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:18,469
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

111
00:08:18,511 --> 00:08:21,251
♪- May time be free of pain;
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

112
00:08:21,300 --> 00:08:23,420
♪You're the only one I need♪

113
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:30,850
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

114
00:08:31,230 --> 00:08:34,350
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

115
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:36,640
♪My last untouched innocence♪

116
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,390
By imperial decree!

117
00:09:03,790 --> 00:09:06,790
Princess Danyang is to reside
at Lizheng Hall for the time being.

118
00:09:25,980 --> 00:09:26,820
(Jiang Heng Colluded
with the Crown Prince to transfer funds)

119
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,600
(Du Ping, Transport Commissioner
of Lingnan,)

120
00:09:29,030 --> 00:09:30,320
(falsified disaster relief expenses.)

121
00:09:32,420 --> 00:09:33,660
(Jiang Heng; Du Ping)

122
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,430
(Labor-tax cloth:)
Pei Xuanming,

123
00:09:35,430 --> 00:09:36,550
(2,000 bolts due, 1,600 received;)
Director of the Bureau of Operations

124
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,910
(Jiang Heng; Du Ping; Pei Xuanming)
accepted bribes from the Crown Prince.

125
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:40,200
(Wang Heling, Vice Minister of Revenue,)

126
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,790
(falsified salt and iron tax records.)

127
00:09:42,540 --> 00:09:43,540
(Jiang Heng; Du Ping;
Pei Xuanming; Cheng An)

128
00:09:58,140 --> 00:10:00,841
(Wei Feng, Cao Jiashi, Zhang Ran, Liu
Mingzheng, Liu Lingming, Liu Dong,)

129
00:10:00,841 --> 00:10:01,780
(Zhou Dewei, Wang Jianian)

130
00:10:01,900 --> 00:10:04,940
(Funds transferred
to the Crown Prince's household.)

131
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:13,080
What's the current

132
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,440
troop deployment at Anwu Gate?

133
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,240
Rest assured, Your Royal Highness.

134
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:18,000
By the third quarter
of the Yin hour tomorrow,

135
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,240
all the Jinwu Guards at Anwu Gate

136
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:20,510
will have been replaced by our men.

137
00:10:20,910 --> 00:10:21,910
For now, the only troops we can rally

138
00:10:22,390 --> 00:10:23,630
are from the Shence Army's
Right Battalion.

139
00:10:24,510 --> 00:10:25,059
Then we can...

140
00:10:25,101 --> 00:10:25,651
Who dares barge in?

141
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:31,550
Your Royal Highness.

142
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,150
It's too late.

143
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:35,480
By imperial command,

144
00:10:35,870 --> 00:10:38,080
I must escort the Crown Prince
to Liangyi Hall immediately.

145
00:10:38,550 --> 00:10:39,320
As for everyone else,

146
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:40,550
arrest them all!

147
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,200
Your Royal Highness!

148
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:42,630
Your Royal Highness!

149
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,219
- Move!
- Hurry up!

150
00:10:43,261 --> 00:10:43,539
Your Royal Highness!

151
00:10:43,580 --> 00:10:43,829
Move!

152
00:10:43,871 --> 00:10:44,539
Your Royal Highness!

153
00:10:44,581 --> 00:10:45,701
- Move!
- Save me, Your Royal Highness!

154
00:10:45,790 --> 00:10:47,150
Your Royal Highness!

155
00:10:47,630 --> 00:10:48,600
Your Royal Highness!

156
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,000
Your Royal Highness.

157
00:10:51,670 --> 00:10:52,240
This way, please.

158
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:55,440
Take a look.

159
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:03,720
Apart from these people,

160
00:11:03,940 --> 00:11:05,580
(Jiang Heng; Du Ping; Pei Xuanming)

161
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,630
have I missed anyone?

162
00:11:14,100 --> 00:11:14,740
(Liu Mingzheng; Liu Lingming;
Wang Jianian)

163
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:19,630
Xun,

164
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:23,030
don't you owe me an explanation?

165
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:28,960
Father,

166
00:11:30,390 --> 00:11:32,000
if I'd had nothing at my disposal,

167
00:11:32,910 --> 00:11:33,390
how could I

168
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:35,480
have rescued you from Yu Cheng'an

169
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:37,200
at the hunting grounds that day?

170
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:42,750
Father,

171
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:45,630
all these years,

172
00:11:46,790 --> 00:11:47,720
I've lived in constant fear for my life.

173
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,200
Right under Yu Cheng'an's nose,

174
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,840
I risked my neck recruiting troops
and forging armor.

175
00:11:53,270 --> 00:11:54,750
Why do you think I did all that?

176
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,550
Don't you understand, Father?

177
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:27,840
Get up.

178
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,480
But Yu Cheng'an

179
00:12:45,550 --> 00:12:47,200
was executed over a month ago.

180
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:50,320
Why have you never submitted

181
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:52,200
an official report on the funds,
provisions,

182
00:12:53,270 --> 00:12:55,720
and private troops under your command?

183
00:12:59,670 --> 00:13:00,360
Why?

184
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:17,840
Xun,

185
00:13:20,670 --> 00:13:23,080
that sword you turned
against Yu Cheng'an...

186
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:25,360
Will you

187
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:30,600
turn it against your own father
tomorrow?

188
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:53,390
Since you've already made up your mind,

189
00:13:54,910 --> 00:13:55,960
why bother asking?

190
00:14:01,670 --> 00:14:02,840
You brought me

191
00:14:03,270 --> 00:14:04,360
here today

192
00:14:05,550 --> 00:14:06,630
and demanded an explanation.

193
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:10,720
You just wanted to humiliate me again,
didn't you?

194
00:14:16,790 --> 00:14:18,030
Just like

195
00:14:22,030 --> 00:14:24,030
Yu Cheng'an did back then.

196
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:28,120
How dare you!

197
00:14:42,550 --> 00:14:43,440
Father,

198
00:14:44,630 --> 00:14:45,750
the two of us...

199
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:48,790
What a ridiculous pair we are.

200
00:14:51,270 --> 00:14:52,720
Absolutely ridiculous!

201
00:15:00,060 --> 00:15:06,300
(Universe in Harmony)

202
00:15:06,420 --> 00:15:07,700
(Lizheng Hall)

203
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:42,720
(Your Highness,)

204
00:15:43,600 --> 00:15:44,550
(those commanders)

205
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:46,360
(merely fear the Crown Prince's power.)

206
00:15:46,910 --> 00:15:48,030
(Do you think they're truly loyal?)

207
00:15:49,270 --> 00:15:50,510
(They're not men who would die for you.)

208
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:51,840
(They're predators who would
turn on their own master.)

209
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,360
(They're not your allies,)

210
00:15:53,670 --> 00:15:54,910
(but the very men who could
bring about your death.)

211
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:56,870
(Those who bargain with tigers)

212
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:58,270
(ultimately become their prey.)

213
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,200
(As time goes on,)

214
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:02,440
(I fear you'll sink into the same mire.)

215
00:16:03,320 --> 00:16:04,510
(How would you be any different
from the Crown Prince?)

216
00:16:09,510 --> 00:16:10,200
That's true.

217
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:14,030
To fight my way out of this swamp,

218
00:16:16,270 --> 00:16:17,840
I'm bound to get covered in mud

219
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:19,510
and resort to whatever it takes.

220
00:16:24,510 --> 00:16:26,440
But I won't become
as rotten as they are.

221
00:16:33,670 --> 00:16:34,360
(In the end,)

222
00:16:35,390 --> 00:16:35,870
(Yan Shang,)

223
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:38,150
(you still don't believe in me.)

224
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:41,120
(You don't believe I can forge
my own path,)

225
00:16:42,150 --> 00:16:42,910
(or that I)

226
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:45,150
(can survive without bowing to anyone.)

227
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:48,750
Hurry up!

228
00:17:01,630 --> 00:17:02,200
Keep moving!

229
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:06,200
Hurry up!

230
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:07,070
Keep moving!

231
00:17:09,510 --> 00:17:10,310
Keep up! Keep up!

232
00:17:13,030 --> 00:17:13,960
Yan Shang!

233
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:19,030
I never thought I'd run into someone
I know in here.

234
00:17:21,110 --> 00:17:23,590
I didn't expect His Majesty
to act so quickly either.

235
00:17:24,830 --> 00:17:25,440
I suppose

236
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,270
the officials in Lingnan
and other circuits

237
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:28,720
who had secret dealings
with the Crown Prince

238
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:30,510
have been dealt with by now.

239
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:31,550
You...

240
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:36,809
I still don't understand

241
00:17:36,851 --> 00:17:37,741
what you're trying to achieve.

242
00:17:38,350 --> 00:17:39,510
You'd already made it back alive.

243
00:17:39,750 --> 00:17:40,680
All you had to do was keep quiet,

244
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:42,160
and neither of us
would be in this prison!

245
00:17:42,510 --> 00:17:43,030
Yang Si,

246
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:45,750
when I first came to Sheng'an,

247
00:17:46,550 --> 00:17:47,880
I never expected to return home alive.

248
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:49,350
And now,

249
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:51,310
nothing has changed.

250
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:55,790
Move!

251
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:15,440
(Serene and Content)
Your Majesty confined the Crown Prince.

252
00:18:16,270 --> 00:18:18,720
What do you intend to do
with Meng Zaishi?

253
00:18:22,030 --> 00:18:24,899
There's one major difference
between Meng Zaishi

254
00:18:24,941 --> 00:18:26,501
and Meng Baiyu and Mu Xianqing.

255
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:28,510
Do you know what it is?

256
00:18:29,550 --> 00:18:31,030
I've heard something about it.

257
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:33,480
The soldiers under Meng Zaishi

258
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:35,480
would all lay down their lives for him.

259
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:40,310
He united the Central Circuit
in remarkably little time,

260
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:42,310
not because

261
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:45,350
he is a Meng,

262
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:46,750
but because of

263
00:18:47,550 --> 00:18:50,160
how he leads his troops
and treats his men.

264
00:18:52,350 --> 00:18:52,960
Exactly.

265
00:18:54,070 --> 00:18:55,790
The Central Circuit's forces

266
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:59,310
have effectively become
Meng Zaishi's private army.

267
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:01,920
But as long as

268
00:19:02,310 --> 00:19:04,310
he remains here in Sheng'an,

269
00:19:05,350 --> 00:19:07,310
his loyal soldiers

270
00:19:08,240 --> 00:19:10,270
won't dare make a move against me.

271
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:13,510
Your Majesty is wise.

272
00:19:14,350 --> 00:19:15,720
With one man in your hands,

273
00:19:16,240 --> 00:19:17,480
you can control an entire army.

274
00:19:19,110 --> 00:19:20,200
However...

275
00:19:24,110 --> 00:19:24,510
What is it?

276
00:19:26,070 --> 00:19:27,350
I just wonder

277
00:19:28,200 --> 00:19:29,960
how long this can last...

278
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:32,720
Your Majesty!

279
00:19:35,750 --> 00:19:36,720
It's nothing.

280
00:19:42,400 --> 00:19:44,440
Perhaps I've overworked myself
these past few days.

281
00:19:44,830 --> 00:19:45,200
I'm tired.

282
00:19:46,110 --> 00:19:47,400
I'll go and rest.

283
00:19:51,550 --> 00:19:51,920
General,

284
00:19:52,510 --> 00:19:53,550
I've brought the pastries you asked for.

285
00:20:21,020 --> 00:20:24,460
(The ambush is in position.)

286
00:21:26,110 --> 00:21:26,440
Here they come!

287
00:21:26,590 --> 00:21:27,729
They should be cut to pieces!

288
00:21:27,771 --> 00:21:29,421
(Wontons; Flatbread)
It's them! Look at those people!

289
00:21:29,510 --> 00:21:30,440
They deserve to be cut to pieces!

290
00:21:31,310 --> 00:21:31,659
Keep moving!

291
00:21:31,701 --> 00:21:32,331
They deserve to die!

292
00:21:32,440 --> 00:21:32,859
Exactly!

293
00:21:32,901 --> 00:21:33,771
They never did anything good!

294
00:21:34,310 --> 00:21:34,960
Bad people!

295
00:21:35,310 --> 00:21:36,289
(Bamboo Goods Shop)
Kid, come here!

296
00:21:36,331 --> 00:21:36,629
Come here!

297
00:21:36,671 --> 00:21:37,061
Bad people!

298
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:37,790
Where are your parents?

299
00:21:38,030 --> 00:21:39,550
They starved to death because of them!

300
00:21:40,720 --> 00:21:41,699
How does dirt taste?

301
00:21:41,741 --> 00:21:42,331
You corrupt officials!

302
00:21:42,680 --> 00:21:43,830
Corrupt officials! Scoundrels!

303
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:45,830
Stand back!

304
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:46,680
Stand back!

305
00:21:47,550 --> 00:21:48,000
Get back!

306
00:21:49,720 --> 00:21:50,400
Move along! Hurry!

307
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:51,960
Everyone, calm down!

308
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:53,400
Please, stay calm!

309
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:54,699
Everyone, calm down!

310
00:21:54,741 --> 00:21:55,371
Make way! Move aside!

311
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:56,899
Make way!

312
00:21:56,941 --> 00:21:57,461
Get lost!

313
00:21:57,550 --> 00:21:58,440
Back! Move back!

314
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:03,680
- Xiaozhou's back!
- Father!

315
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:04,350
Brother!

316
00:22:06,480 --> 00:22:08,240
Something's happened!

317
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:09,270
What happened?

318
00:22:09,400 --> 00:22:10,160
Wonderful news!

319
00:22:10,480 --> 00:22:11,270
Wonderful news?

320
00:22:11,640 --> 00:22:12,070
Father,

321
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:13,750
I heard the court sent troops

322
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:15,640
to arrest the Military Governor
of Lingnan.

323
00:22:16,160 --> 00:22:18,400
Nearly all the corrupt officials
have been arrested too.

324
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:19,960
When I went to the county market,

325
00:22:20,200 --> 00:22:22,270
I saw lots of people
who'd fled the famine

326
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:24,110
returning home in groups.

327
00:22:24,830 --> 00:22:25,640
And when I got into town,

328
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:27,750
I saw a notice posted at the city gate.

329
00:22:29,550 --> 00:22:30,310
What did it say?

330
00:22:30,590 --> 00:22:33,310
New disaster relief funds
will arrive within a month.

331
00:22:33,590 --> 00:22:35,590
They'll review land records
and return land to the people,

332
00:22:35,790 --> 00:22:37,400
and give landless refugees plots
to cultivate.

333
00:22:37,590 --> 00:22:38,030
And...

334
00:22:39,720 --> 00:22:41,400
There'll be no taxes for three years.

335
00:22:43,720 --> 00:22:44,590
Three years!

336
00:22:48,550 --> 00:22:49,200
It was Shang.

337
00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:56,270
Shang did this!

338
00:23:14,920 --> 00:23:15,400
Wanyao.

339
00:23:22,070 --> 00:23:22,790
Your Majesty.

340
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:30,030
What?

341
00:23:30,790 --> 00:23:31,790
Are you angry

342
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:32,750
because I made you reflect
on your actions?

343
00:23:37,160 --> 00:23:38,350
Everything Yan Shang wrote

344
00:23:38,790 --> 00:23:39,720
has been verified.

345
00:23:40,310 --> 00:23:43,480
Chancellor Liu said hardship
had strengthened his resolve.

346
00:23:44,310 --> 00:23:45,070
He was right.

347
00:23:49,750 --> 00:23:50,480
Just look at you.

348
00:23:51,070 --> 00:23:52,049
You were so picky,

349
00:23:52,091 --> 00:23:53,771
and look who you ended up with.

350
00:23:54,440 --> 00:23:55,480
How foolish!

351
00:23:56,270 --> 00:23:58,979
Even as the husband
of an ordinary woman,

352
00:23:59,021 --> 00:24:01,461
he'd never put his wife
and children first.

353
00:24:01,720 --> 00:24:03,030
How could he possibly be

354
00:24:03,270 --> 00:24:05,030
a suitable husband
for a princess of Huai?

355
00:24:06,030 --> 00:24:06,480
Your Majesty,

356
00:24:07,830 --> 00:24:08,750
I've already given up on him.

357
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:11,270
Sit down.

358
00:24:17,510 --> 00:24:17,960
Wanyao,

359
00:24:18,480 --> 00:24:19,440
do you remember

360
00:24:20,070 --> 00:24:21,070
the story I once told you

361
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:23,030
about Zhuangzi's

362
00:24:24,590 --> 00:24:26,400
useless tree?

363
00:24:27,790 --> 00:24:28,350
Being useless

364
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:30,270
is what saves it from the axe.

365
00:24:31,200 --> 00:24:34,000
If you could simply be content
as a princess

366
00:24:34,830 --> 00:24:36,030
and stop meddling in things,

367
00:24:37,790 --> 00:24:39,270
you could keep yourself safe.

368
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:43,830
That night at the hunting grounds,

369
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:46,590
my own safety never crossed my mind.

370
00:24:52,200 --> 00:24:55,920
You're the second person
to bring up that night with me.

371
00:24:57,680 --> 00:24:58,400
Do you think

372
00:24:59,590 --> 00:25:01,350
I'm also trying to claim credit
and beg for mercy?

373
00:25:03,550 --> 00:25:06,480
If all women were this sharp-tongued,

374
00:25:06,750 --> 00:25:08,440
they'd only invite trouble.

375
00:25:16,830 --> 00:25:17,920
Think of your mother.

376
00:25:18,640 --> 00:25:21,030
How magnificent she looked
drawing her bow!

377
00:25:21,960 --> 00:25:24,790
And look how she ended up.

378
00:25:30,070 --> 00:25:30,920
Weapons like these

379
00:25:32,160 --> 00:25:34,070
can't protect a woman.

380
00:25:34,830 --> 00:25:37,030
They only bring deadly trouble upon her.

381
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:38,920
Being gentle and yielding

382
00:25:39,510 --> 00:25:40,830
is the key to survival.

383
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:43,310
Remember when you were little?

384
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:47,400
You were gentle, sweet, and sensible.

385
00:25:48,270 --> 00:25:50,590
If you could be like that again,

386
00:25:51,510 --> 00:25:52,720
obedient and well-behaved,

387
00:25:53,550 --> 00:25:55,110
I would protect you

388
00:25:55,680 --> 00:25:56,400
and cherish you.

389
00:25:57,960 --> 00:25:59,240
Just keep your hands

390
00:25:59,960 --> 00:26:01,270
away from things

391
00:26:02,110 --> 00:26:03,550
you have no business touching.

392
00:26:06,750 --> 00:26:07,640
What happened to the Crown Prince?

393
00:26:10,480 --> 00:26:11,510
Huai

394
00:26:12,070 --> 00:26:13,070
no longer has a Crown Prince.

395
00:26:19,400 --> 00:26:20,440
You're different from him.

396
00:26:21,400 --> 00:26:23,440
You're my precious daughter.

397
00:26:24,400 --> 00:26:26,750
Now that Yan Shang is gone,

398
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:29,200
you can continue living in the palace.

399
00:26:29,880 --> 00:26:30,790
What's more,

400
00:26:31,680 --> 00:26:34,310
I've even made the best arrangements
for you.

401
00:26:37,000 --> 00:26:37,310
No.

402
00:26:39,640 --> 00:26:40,590
I want to return to my residence.

403
00:26:42,110 --> 00:26:44,249
Your residence has no guards now.

404
00:26:44,291 --> 00:26:45,221
Don't go back.

405
00:26:45,750 --> 00:26:46,550
Stay here

406
00:26:47,480 --> 00:26:48,680
and keep me company.

407
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:51,590
Back then,

408
00:26:52,350 --> 00:26:53,590
for the stability of Huai,

409
00:26:54,070 --> 00:26:55,880
you agreed to marry the Military
Commander of the Central Circuit.

410
00:26:57,110 --> 00:26:58,179
Now, Meng Zaishi...

411
00:26:58,221 --> 00:26:59,021
I won't do it!

412
00:27:04,750 --> 00:27:05,720
Why not?

413
00:27:06,310 --> 00:27:07,769
Meng Zaishi is in his prime,

414
00:27:07,811 --> 00:27:09,261
and he's devoted to you.

415
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:10,880
Back then, I only gave in to Yu Cheng'an

416
00:27:11,400 --> 00:27:13,030
for your sake and Mother's.

417
00:27:13,680 --> 00:27:14,350
And now,

418
00:27:14,830 --> 00:27:16,350
my own father is the one forcing me.

419
00:27:18,030 --> 00:27:19,569
Oh, you silly girl!

420
00:27:19,611 --> 00:27:20,981
How is that the same?

421
00:27:21,960 --> 00:27:22,920
Back then, you had to marry

422
00:27:23,270 --> 00:27:26,000
and moved far away to the bitter cold
of the Central Circuit.

423
00:27:26,750 --> 00:27:27,270
But now,

424
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:29,550
Meng Zaishi is at the palace.

425
00:27:31,030 --> 00:27:32,750
I won't allow him to leave Sheng'an.

426
00:27:33,200 --> 00:27:34,750
You want us both to become

427
00:27:35,440 --> 00:27:37,350
a pair of declawed, defanged playthings

428
00:27:37,640 --> 00:27:38,510
for your amusement?

429
00:27:38,750 --> 00:27:39,400
Do as you're told!

430
00:27:53,830 --> 00:27:54,440
Be obedient.

431
00:27:54,960 --> 00:27:57,110
You're my precious daughter.

432
00:27:57,510 --> 00:27:58,440
As your father, I'll

433
00:27:59,350 --> 00:28:00,310
arrange your marriage

434
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:02,350
and grant you both

435
00:28:02,960 --> 00:28:03,960
the right to settle in Sheng'an.

436
00:28:11,070 --> 00:28:12,750
A wolf will never become a vegetarian.

437
00:28:14,440 --> 00:28:15,640
He won't agree.

438
00:28:19,000 --> 00:28:20,480
He already has.

439
00:28:59,030 --> 00:28:59,680
What rotten luck!

440
00:29:00,200 --> 00:29:01,270
What's with all this spooky behavior?

441
00:29:04,680 --> 00:29:05,350
Excuse me.

442
00:29:06,590 --> 00:29:07,350
Is today

443
00:29:08,030 --> 00:29:09,110
the fifteenth?

444
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:11,790
What time is it?

445
00:29:15,030 --> 00:29:16,160
Can't you see that huge moon?

446
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:21,920
It's just past the hour of Hai.

447
00:30:19,240 --> 00:30:20,200
That physician

448
00:30:21,270 --> 00:30:22,590
was right after all.

449
00:30:25,720 --> 00:30:28,160
General Meng has been granted
the title of Prince Consort.

450
00:30:28,680 --> 00:30:31,310
His Majesty asks Your Highness
to make preparations.

451
00:30:31,680 --> 00:30:34,160
The wedding will take place
in three days.

452
00:30:36,310 --> 00:30:38,310
How could he agree to such humiliation?

453
00:30:39,830 --> 00:30:40,590
He's lost his mind.

454
00:30:41,960 --> 00:30:43,859
The Court of Imperial Sacrifices
and the Court of State Ceremonial

455
00:30:43,901 --> 00:30:45,771
are urgently working out
the wedding arrangements.

456
00:30:46,440 --> 00:30:47,510
What does the Court of State
Ceremonial have to do with this?

457
00:30:48,160 --> 00:30:49,350
Because the Prince Consort

458
00:30:49,790 --> 00:30:51,680
made a request of His Majesty.

459
00:31:00,440 --> 00:31:01,830
Your Majesty has shown me
boundless generosity

460
00:31:03,720 --> 00:31:04,920
by granting me the Princess's hand.

461
00:31:06,640 --> 00:31:08,070
I'm deeply humbled.

462
00:31:09,920 --> 00:31:11,000
I have only one wish.

463
00:31:12,030 --> 00:31:13,790
I humbly ask Your Majesty to grant it.

464
00:31:16,720 --> 00:31:18,480
For my wedding to Princess Danyang,

465
00:31:19,510 --> 00:31:22,880
I ask that we follow the wedding customs
of both Sheng'an and North Jing equally.

466
00:31:25,350 --> 00:31:27,880
For this is not merely a celebration
for my family.

467
00:31:29,640 --> 00:31:32,480
It is an honor for all three military
districts of North Jing.

468
00:31:36,000 --> 00:31:36,939
The wedding protocol

469
00:31:36,981 --> 00:31:39,331
must be revised by both courts
and the Ministry of Rites.

470
00:31:39,920 --> 00:31:40,400
However,

471
00:31:41,110 --> 00:31:43,960
the ceremonial robes, headdress,
and jewelry for Your Highness

472
00:31:44,350 --> 00:31:45,350
are already prepared.

473
00:31:46,720 --> 00:31:47,160
Come in!

474
00:32:00,140 --> 00:32:01,480
(Suicheng)

475
00:32:01,480 --> 00:32:06,040
(Wenmo Pavilion; Suicheng; Inn)

476
00:32:16,110 --> 00:32:16,590
Sir!

477
00:32:17,830 --> 00:32:18,310
Sir!

478
00:32:27,160 --> 00:32:27,830
My master...

479
00:32:29,270 --> 00:32:30,720
He's been dismissed and imprisoned.

480
00:32:31,590 --> 00:32:32,480
All his family's land and property

481
00:32:33,270 --> 00:32:34,350
have been confiscated.

482
00:32:34,550 --> 00:32:35,440
If I'd been any later,

483
00:32:36,110 --> 00:32:37,440
I wouldn't have escaped,

484
00:32:37,790 --> 00:32:39,680
and I'd never see you again.

485
00:32:47,960 --> 00:32:48,590
Take your time.

486
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:51,030
Tell me everything from the beginning.

487
00:33:07,550 --> 00:33:08,550
Master left a message.

488
00:33:09,160 --> 00:33:10,350
He said the Liu family's downfall

489
00:33:11,110 --> 00:33:12,830
is all Yan Shang the Collator's doing.

490
00:33:13,200 --> 00:33:13,750
That is,

491
00:33:14,400 --> 00:33:16,240
your former classmate, sir.

492
00:33:38,960 --> 00:33:39,590
Now,

493
00:33:40,510 --> 00:33:42,070
the entire Liu family is ruined.

494
00:33:45,350 --> 00:33:46,110
He said

495
00:33:47,510 --> 00:33:48,400
only you

496
00:33:50,200 --> 00:33:51,880
can avenge the Liu family.

497
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:34,230
Shang.

498
00:34:36,190 --> 00:34:36,630
It's me.

499
00:34:38,920 --> 00:34:39,550
Wenji.

500
00:34:55,190 --> 00:34:56,110
I've wronged you.

501
00:35:04,230 --> 00:35:05,030
Why do you say that?

502
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:07,840
The Lingnan case...

503
00:35:10,840 --> 00:35:12,360
It's mostly been settled by now,
hasn't it?

504
00:35:14,360 --> 00:35:15,030
Your family...

505
00:35:20,230 --> 00:35:21,150
You can't manage that yourself, can you?

506
00:35:22,230 --> 00:35:22,710
I'll feed you.

507
00:35:29,230 --> 00:35:29,710
I'm sorry.

508
00:35:46,320 --> 00:35:47,000
My family is ruined.

509
00:35:50,710 --> 00:35:51,190
I know.

510
00:36:05,550 --> 00:36:06,190
This medicine

511
00:36:07,320 --> 00:36:08,480
improves circulation
and reduces bruising.

512
00:36:08,960 --> 00:36:09,710
It's very effective.

513
00:36:15,230 --> 00:36:16,000
Wenji.

514
00:36:21,550 --> 00:36:22,110
Thank you.

515
00:36:47,630 --> 00:36:48,000
Shang,

516
00:36:53,230 --> 00:36:54,880
I've been in the palace long enough.

517
00:36:57,150 --> 00:36:58,510
Do you think I can't see
what's happening?

518
00:37:00,800 --> 00:37:02,360
His Majesty was the one who sent you
to Lingnan.

519
00:37:05,150 --> 00:37:06,670
The moment he made that decision,

520
00:37:09,400 --> 00:37:10,480
my family was already doomed.

521
00:37:15,840 --> 00:37:17,760
If this is the outcome
His Majesty wanted,

522
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:20,840
then it wouldn't matter

523
00:37:23,230 --> 00:37:23,920
who he sent.

524
00:37:27,550 --> 00:37:29,550
Even if he'd sent me,

525
00:37:33,440 --> 00:37:35,630
I'd have had no choice
but to put justice above family.

526
00:37:37,670 --> 00:37:38,360
Wenji...

527
00:38:05,840 --> 00:38:06,510
What happened to your eyes?

528
00:38:08,630 --> 00:38:09,510
While I was in Lingnan,

529
00:38:10,150 --> 00:38:11,280
I had a little accident.

530
00:38:12,840 --> 00:38:13,590
I've lost my sight.

531
00:38:14,710 --> 00:38:15,230
Don't worry.

532
00:38:16,070 --> 00:38:16,880
I'll find a way to help.

533
00:38:18,150 --> 00:38:19,150
I'll get an imperial physician
to see you.

534
00:38:22,510 --> 00:38:23,230
No need.

535
00:38:24,190 --> 00:38:25,000
That won't be difficult to arrange.

536
00:38:30,630 --> 00:38:32,110
His Majesty doesn't want you dead yet.

537
00:38:48,320 --> 00:38:49,190
There's something else

538
00:38:50,190 --> 00:38:51,150
you probably don't know.

539
00:38:56,190 --> 00:38:57,670
His Majesty has arranged a marriage.

540
00:38:59,030 --> 00:39:00,030
Meng Zaishi

541
00:39:01,280 --> 00:39:02,840
is to marry Princess Danyang.

542
00:39:34,190 --> 00:39:35,070
We're stuck again?

543
00:39:37,760 --> 00:39:38,480
I'll get out and take a look.

544
00:39:38,880 --> 00:39:39,360
Pacification Commissioner,

545
00:39:41,070 --> 00:39:41,960
you may have to get out.

546
00:39:43,150 --> 00:39:44,070
I'm afraid

547
00:39:44,760 --> 00:39:45,590
we can't go any farther.

548
00:39:52,020 --> 00:39:56,660
(North Jing)

549
00:40:07,880 --> 00:40:09,360
General Meng can't come back,

550
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:11,000
so they sent you instead?

551
00:40:12,590 --> 00:40:14,110
They claim to have a written order.

552
00:40:15,000 --> 00:40:15,440
Show me!

553
00:40:26,150 --> 00:40:27,550
(An Shahe, Meng Zaishi's Personal Guard)
All is well.

554
00:40:28,400 --> 00:40:30,070
I'll return soon.

555
00:40:37,190 --> 00:40:38,739
Didn't that darned emperor
say the same thing

556
00:40:38,781 --> 00:40:40,091
when he let you return?

557
00:40:40,360 --> 00:40:41,630
It's all just empty promises!

558
00:40:44,000 --> 00:40:45,590
General Meng wrote this himself!

559
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:47,630
Do you think he'd be pleased
to hear you say that?

560
00:40:48,960 --> 00:40:50,360
I also have a decree from His Majesty.

561
00:40:53,400 --> 00:40:54,590
When Yu's faction plotted rebellion,

562
00:40:55,110 --> 00:40:56,000
the imperial court was thrown
into chaos.

563
00:40:56,280 --> 00:40:57,590
You led the Gray Wolf Cavalry

564
00:40:57,920 --> 00:40:58,880
and rushed to my rescue.

565
00:40:59,150 --> 00:41:00,110
What that means is,

566
00:41:00,440 --> 00:41:02,920
Yu Cheng'an was terrible
when he controlled the court,

567
00:41:03,440 --> 00:41:05,190
but General Meng saved His Majesty

568
00:41:05,480 --> 00:41:06,070
and rendered great service.

569
00:41:06,920 --> 00:41:07,510
He is hereby promoted

570
00:41:07,840 --> 00:41:09,440
to Commander of All Military Affairs
in North Jing,

571
00:41:09,840 --> 00:41:10,510
with a fief yielding revenue

572
00:41:11,070 --> 00:41:11,630
from 500 households.

573
00:41:12,670 --> 00:41:13,190
In short,

574
00:41:13,630 --> 00:41:15,030
His Majesty has rewarded him generously

575
00:41:15,510 --> 00:41:17,320
and invited him to stay
at the palace a little longer.

576
00:41:20,320 --> 00:41:20,590
You...

577
00:41:20,710 --> 00:41:21,880
I get it now!

578
00:41:21,960 --> 00:41:24,230
That darned emperor is holding
General Meng hostage!

579
00:41:25,000 --> 00:41:27,169
No! General Meng will come back!

580
00:41:27,211 --> 00:41:27,901
When will he be back?

581
00:41:28,190 --> 00:41:29,070
Is that up to you?

582
00:41:29,590 --> 00:41:30,880
No, wait! Let him go first!

583
00:41:31,070 --> 00:41:31,760
Let him go!

584
00:41:31,880 --> 00:41:33,840
Let go! Let go!

585
00:41:34,630 --> 00:41:35,630
Let go!

586
00:41:38,550 --> 00:41:39,000
What do we do?

587
00:41:39,880 --> 00:41:41,070
The general must be in danger.

588
00:41:41,360 --> 00:41:42,590
(Gu Han, Meng Zaishi's Personal Guard)
Muster the troops! We march now!

589
00:41:42,920 --> 00:41:43,550
As for these two,

590
00:41:44,190 --> 00:41:44,800
kill them now!

591
00:41:46,110 --> 00:41:46,960
Go ahead and march!

592
00:41:47,480 --> 00:41:48,880
You'll be the ones
who get General Meng killed!

593
00:41:49,110 --> 00:41:50,230
General Meng gave no such order,

594
00:41:50,630 --> 00:41:51,760
yet you're mobilizing troops
without his permission.

595
00:41:52,150 --> 00:41:53,590
Are you really worried about his safety,

596
00:41:54,110 --> 00:41:55,569
or are you trying to seize
his position in the chaos?

597
00:41:55,611 --> 00:41:56,941
Nonsense!

598
00:41:58,320 --> 00:42:00,110
If you're truly concerned
for General Meng's safety,

599
00:42:00,360 --> 00:42:01,480
then let him finish!

600
00:42:03,070 --> 00:42:04,760
If His Majesty really intended
to kill General Meng,

601
00:42:05,110 --> 00:42:06,550
why would he send us with a message?

602
00:42:07,320 --> 00:42:09,320
To invite North Jing's army
to lay waste to Sheng'an?

603
00:42:12,840 --> 00:42:13,840
Mu Xianqing is dead.

604
00:42:14,710 --> 00:42:17,070
All of North Jing now follows
General Meng's command.

605
00:42:17,880 --> 00:42:19,230
With 100,000 soldiers under his command,

606
00:42:19,480 --> 00:42:20,920
if His Majesty were to kill him,

607
00:42:21,480 --> 00:42:22,960
wouldn't he fear a rebellion
in North Jing?

608
00:42:24,280 --> 00:42:25,030
He's the top scholar!

609
00:42:25,360 --> 00:42:27,230
All he knows is reading classics
and writing essays.

610
00:42:27,590 --> 00:42:28,670
He couldn't even kill a chicken!

611
00:42:29,070 --> 00:42:29,819
He brought only me, a defenseless woman,

612
00:42:29,861 --> 00:42:31,051
to deliver this message,

613
00:42:31,360 --> 00:42:32,190
without a single armed soldier.

614
00:42:32,710 --> 00:42:34,960
Doesn't that prove Huai's sincerity?

615
00:42:40,360 --> 00:42:41,590
That emperor is cunning.

616
00:42:42,280 --> 00:42:43,920
He sent these two helpless lambs here.

617
00:42:44,550 --> 00:42:46,320
Who knows what he's really plotting?

618
00:42:46,590 --> 00:42:47,070
Kill them!

619
00:42:47,550 --> 00:42:48,710
General Meng is unharmed for now,

620
00:42:49,440 --> 00:42:50,590
but his life truly hangs by a thread!

621
00:42:50,840 --> 00:42:51,190
What?

622
00:42:53,030 --> 00:42:54,230
Every word I've said is true.

623
00:42:54,590 --> 00:42:55,710
Think carefully, and you'll understand.

624
00:42:56,030 --> 00:42:56,960
What His Majesty fears

625
00:42:57,320 --> 00:42:58,070
isn't General Meng himself,

626
00:42:58,920 --> 00:43:00,360
but another Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors.

627
00:43:01,280 --> 00:43:02,670
As long as you hold your positions here,

628
00:43:03,150 --> 00:43:03,670
the court

629
00:43:04,280 --> 00:43:05,760
won't dare lay a finger on General Meng.

630
00:43:06,960 --> 00:43:08,400
None of that matters!

631
00:43:08,800 --> 00:43:09,800
Just answer me!

632
00:43:10,150 --> 00:43:12,710
Why is that emperor
holding General Meng?

633
00:43:13,550 --> 00:43:14,360
Isn't it obvious?

634
00:43:14,710 --> 00:43:16,880
General Meng is a hostage now!

635
00:43:20,150 --> 00:43:21,000
Which means,

636
00:43:21,670 --> 00:43:23,190
the person most afraid
of anything happening to him

637
00:43:23,800 --> 00:43:24,480
isn't any of you,

638
00:43:25,440 --> 00:43:26,630
but the Emperor of Huai.

639
00:43:47,630 --> 00:43:48,710
Take them away

640
00:43:49,230 --> 00:43:49,670
and get them settled.

641
00:45:00,340 --> 00:45:04,780
(Next Episode Preview)

642
00:45:05,630 --> 00:45:06,840
Don't let your general down.

643
00:45:07,510 --> 00:45:08,800
Don't let him die for nothing!

644
00:45:10,150 --> 00:45:10,960
I'm going back

645
00:45:11,670 --> 00:45:12,670
to demand justice

646
00:45:13,230 --> 00:45:14,230
for General Meng.

647
00:45:15,510 --> 00:45:18,400
Princess Danyang has returned
from North Jing.

648
00:45:21,481 --> 00:45:24,774
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

649
00:45:27,459 --> 00:45:32,375
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

650
00:45:34,569 --> 00:45:40,414
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

651
00:45:40,914 --> 00:45:46,140
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

652
00:45:48,909 --> 00:45:53,700
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

653
00:45:54,536 --> 00:46:00,615
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

654
00:46:02,416 --> 00:46:05,566
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

655
00:46:05,566 --> 00:46:07,214
♪Burning bright as a song♪

656
00:46:07,266 --> 00:46:10,990
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

657
00:46:11,368 --> 00:46:16,034
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

658
00:46:16,653 --> 00:46:20,694
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

659
00:46:21,185 --> 00:46:23,300
♪Not a single hour less♪

660
00:46:23,340 --> 00:46:30,286
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

661
00:46:31,049 --> 00:46:34,502
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

662
00:46:34,682 --> 00:46:37,827
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

663
00:46:38,266 --> 00:46:44,903
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

664
00:46:45,300 --> 00:46:47,338
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

665
00:46:47,338 --> 00:46:49,814
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

666
00:46:49,852 --> 00:46:52,321
♪You're the only one I need♪

667
00:46:52,525 --> 00:46:59,412
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

668
00:46:59,724 --> 00:47:02,995
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

669
00:47:03,300 --> 00:47:06,473
♪My last untouched innocence♪

670
00:47:06,797 --> 00:47:10,223
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

671
00:47:10,456 --> 00:47:13,681
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

672
00:47:14,012 --> 00:47:20,808
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

673
00:47:21,177 --> 00:47:23,239
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

674
00:47:23,240 --> 00:47:25,743
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

675
00:47:25,790 --> 00:47:28,128
♪You're the only one I need♪

676
00:47:28,359 --> 00:47:35,194
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

677
00:47:35,543 --> 00:47:37,161
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

678
00:47:37,291 --> 00:47:39,087
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

679
00:47:39,444 --> 00:47:42,461
♪You're the only one I need♪

680
00:47:42,501 --> 00:47:43,828
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

